l8: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ∀ t (ra_bsucc y t ∈ lrel → nvf' t = suc (nvf' y)) $ by all_intro [l7]
l9: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ f192_bs_q  $ by cab_intro [l8]
l10: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ $ by ax
l11: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  , y = ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f192_bs_q  $ by wcel_intro [l10, l9]
