l13: $ G , x8 ∊ ω , x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  ⇒ ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f192_bs_q  $ by isset_elim [l12, l11]
l14: $ G ⇒ x8 ∊ ω → x9 ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn x9 ⊆ f192_bs_q  → ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ∈ f192_bs_q  $ by imp_intro [imp_intro [imp_intro [l13]]]
