l375: $ G , ra_baddc ty vb vc ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (ty = ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = x2 ∧ vc = x3 ∧ ra_bsucc x2 x3 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x3 (ty = x1 ∧ vb = ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vc = x3 ∧ ra_bsucc x1 x3 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (ty = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vc = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_badd x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (ty = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vc = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_baddc x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (ty = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vc = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_baddc x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (ty = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ vc = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_baddc x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_baddc_cases [l374]
l376: $ G , ra_baddc ty vb vc ∈ lrel , ty = ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = x2 ∧ vc = x3 ∧ ra_bsucc x2 x3 ∈ lrel ⇒ ty = ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∧ vb = x2 ∧ vc = x3 ∧ ra_bsucc x2 x3 ∈ lrel $ by ax
