beq_eqs_p4
----------
l1: $ x0 = enc_ctx G , x1 = enc_expr f , x2 = enc_expr B , x3 = enc_expr t , x4 = enc_expr u ⇒ x0 = enc_ctx G $ by ax
l2: $ x0 = enc_ctx G , x1 = enc_expr f , x2 = enc_expr B , x3 = enc_expr t , x4 = enc_expr u ⇒ x1 = enc_expr f $ by ax
l3: $ x0 = enc_ctx G , x1 = enc_expr f , x2 = enc_expr B , x3 = enc_expr t , x4 = enc_expr u ⇒ x2 = enc_expr B $ by ax
l4: $ x0 = enc_ctx G , x1 = enc_expr f , x2 = enc_expr B , x3 = enc_expr t , x4 = enc_expr u ⇒ x3 = enc_expr t $ by ax
