l511: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x ∊ nnat , y ∊ nnat ⇒ ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) x) (nsc y) = ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (fp)) w t) (ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) x) y) $ by eq_trans [eq_sym [l432], eq_trans [l357, l509]]
