l513: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x ∊ nnat ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ nnat → ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) x) (nsc y) = ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (fp)) w t) (ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) x) y)) $ by all_intro [l512]
