l526: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x5 ∊ ω , x6 ∊ ω , p = nnf' x5 , z = ∅ ⇒ ∀ x (x ∊ nnat → ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) x) nzr = x) $ by weaken [l313]
