l547: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x5 ∊ ω , x6 ∊ ω , p = nnf' x5 , k ∊ ω , ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) p) (nnf' k) = nnf' (nsub x5 k) , z = suc k , q = nnf' k ⇒ ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) p) (nnf' z) = ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) p) (nsc q) $ by ap_eq [l543, eq_trans [l546, nsc_eq [eq_sym [l540]]]]
l548: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x5 ∊ ω , x6 ∊ ω , p = nnf' x5 , k ∊ ω , ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (f)) w t) p) (nnf' k) = nnf' (nsub x5 k) , z = suc k , q = nnf' k ⇒ p ∊ nnat $ by weaken [l520]
