l236: $ … ⇒ (∃ o ∃ p ∃ v ∃ r ∃ x0 (z = ⟨ kc_ind_rec , scons o (scons v (scons r ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t = ⟨ kc_ind_rec , scons p (scons v (scons x0 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_eqv o p ∈ lrel2 ∧ lveq r x0) ∨ ∃ k ∃ v ∃ x ∃ x1 (z = ⟨ kc_proj , scons k (scons v (scons x ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t = ⟨ kc_proj , scons k (scons v (scons x1 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_eeqv x x1 ∈ lrel2)) → dt u M z w d = dt u M t w d $ by or_elim_imp [l158, l175]
