l98: $ G , ∃ x3 (t1 = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_bor x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 (t1 = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_bor x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
