l105: $ G , t1 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_bor x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_bor x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel $ by ax
