l316: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , yy0 ∊ nnat , yy1 ∊ cpi yy2 nnat (cpi yy3 (ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ty le_D nz)) w t) yy0) yy2) (uni' ∅)) ⇒ enc_expr (app (app (bvar nz) (bvar n1)) (app (ind_ctor le_D nz nz) (bvar n1))) ∈ trees ω $ by enc_expr_trees
