l91: $ G , x3 ∊ ω , ∀ x8 (x8 ∊ x3 → ap (ap F (nnf' x8)) (nnf' ∅) = nnf' x8) , e = ∅ , q ∊ ω ∧ ap (ap F (nnf' (ndiv x3 two))) (nnf' (ndiv e two)) = nnf' q ∧ ap (ap F (nnf' x3)) (nnf' e) = nnf' (nadd (nadd q q) (nmod (nadd (nmod x3 two) (nmod e two)) two)) , ∅ ∈ x3 , h = ndiv x3 two ⇒ q = h $ by nnf_inj [l90, l79, eq_trans [eq_sym [l87], l82]]
